<ans># Care Health Insurance Ltd — Q1 FY27 Public Disclosure Data

## Research Status: Document Not Retrievable

<div style="border-left:4px solid #EF4444;background:#FEF2F2;padding:8px 12px;margin:8px 0;border-radius:4px;">
<span style="color:#EF4444;font-weight:600">Unable to locate the Q1 FY2026-27 (quarter ended 30 June 2026) statutory disclosure</span> for Care Health Insurance Ltd despite an exhaustive research effort — 8 distinct research steps spanning direct URL reads, 15+ targeted web searches, and news searches.
</div>

### Key Findings From the Investigation

- **Target URL `https://cms.careinsurance.com/cms/public/public_disclosure`** is a dynamically-rendered (JavaScript) listing page. Extraction was attempted in both fast and slow modes, twice, and failed both times — the quarter-specific PDF links behind this page could not be enumerated. <doc_source>step3web1</doc_source>
- **`https://www.careinsurance.com/public-disclosures.html`** (the public-facing disclosures index) also failed extraction for the same dynamic-content reason. <doc_source>step7web1</doc_source>
- Searches for the specific "FY 26-27 / Qtr 1 26-27" filename pattern the company consistently uses (e.g., prior quarter's file was `.../FY%2025-26/Qtr%204%2025-26/Public_Disclosure_1780465863.pdf`) returned <span style="color:#EF4444;font-weight:600">no indexed Q1 FY27 document</span> — search engines have evidently not yet crawled/cached this quarter's upload.
- Care Health Insurance Ltd is an **unlisted entity** (majority-owned by Religare Enterprises Ltd), so it does not file results on BSE/NSE corporate-announcement portals. Its only disclosure channel is its own website — the one that is inaccessible to automated extraction. This explains why BSE/NSE-specific searches surfaced only unrelated listed companies (GIC Re, BSE Ltd, Star Health, etc.).
- No separate "Investor Presentation Q1 FY27" deck for Care Health Insurance was found on any investor-relations CDN or exchange filing.

Per the sourcing-integrity protocol — since figures could not be verified from the exact mandated document and no reliable alternative statutory filing was found for Q1FY27 specifically — **all values are left blank** rather than estimated or substituted.

